ind":"announcement","title":"Community Translations — Steam Workshop & Translation Tool","summary":"Community Translation Support Coming to ANTI-ANTI Hello! I'm the solo developer behind ANTI-ANTI, 5J6B Works. With the full release approaching on October 27, I'd like to introduce a new feature that will be available at launch. ANTI-ANTI will support community-created translation patches through Steam Workshop. In addition to the officially supported Korean, English, and Japanese languages, I've prepared a translation tool that will allow players to create translations in other languages or mak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T07:07:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041345","verified_at":"2026-10-25T11:05:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982060-1847286114033412","game_id":"steam-4982060","kind":"announcement","title":"ANTI-ANTI Hits 1,000 Steam Wishlists!","summary":"STEAM WISHLIST 1,000+ANTI-ANTI Hits 1,000 Wishlists!Thanks to your interest and support, ANTI-ANTI has reached 1,000 wishlists on Steam!A heartfelt thank you to everyone who discovered the game and added it to their wishlist.Official Release: October 27!I can't wait to share the full story with you. Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:31:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033412","verified_at":"2026-10-22T17:24:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982060-1846651706693893","game_id":"steam-4982060","kind":"announcement","title":"New Emojis Added to Our Official Discord!","summary":"You can now use exclusive emojis in the official Discord server for Anti-anti!We'll continue adding more emojis in the future.Our Discord community is still small, so we'd love for you to join us! https://discord.gg/z6xx35nrTm","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:26:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693893","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982060-1846651706680318","game_id":"steam-4982060","kind":"announcement","title":"ANTI-ANTI – Steam Next Fest Participation & Full Release Announcement","summary":"ANTI-ANTI will be participating in Steam Next Fest, running from October 19 to 26!After Steam Next Fest ends, the demo will no longer be available for download on Steam, with the full game launching on October 27!We hope you'll look forward to the release!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:50:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680318","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982060-1846018067937851","game_id":"steam-4982060","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Discord Server Announcement","summary":"Hello, players! has an official Discord server!https://discord.gg/z6xx35nrTmAs is currently in the demo release stage, minor update announcements are posted exclusively on Discord.The server includes channels for update announcements, bug reports, general discussions, and spoiler discussions covering content up to the end of the demo.Please note that the server is primarily operated in Korean, so users who speak other languages may experience some inconvenience.Thank you for your understanding.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T05:50:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937851","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982060-1844751498220765","game_id":"steam-4982060","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Coming October 1 & Full Release Date Announced","summary":"📢 Release Schedule Demo Release October 1, 2026 — 10:00 PM KST / 6:00 AM PDT Full Release October 27, 2026 — 5:00 PM KST / 1:00 AM PDT 🎮 Demo Release Just one week to go! The demo is coming! The demo will be released on October 1 at 6:00 AM PDT! The demo includes approximately 1–2 hours of content from the beginning of the game. Your achievements and progress from the demo will carry over to the full version. ✨ Full Release The full version of will be released on October 27 at 1:00 AM PDT.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T09:18:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220765","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982060-1840310314348974","game_id":"steam-4982060","kind":"announcement","title":"Pre-Release Schedule","summary":"Hello! This is my first time introducing myself here. I'm 5J6B, the solo developer behind 5J6B Works.Anti-anti is scheduled for release in Q4 2026 (currently planned for October, subject to change).Before its release, the game will be featured on the crowdfunding platform Tumblbug and will also participate in Steam Next Fest.You can follow the official X account for the latest updates.(We're also running an RT event on X to help spread the word!)Tumblbug Campaign Launch: August 15, 18:00 KSTWe w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T09:20:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348974","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analy